tle=\"Графики с източник за всичко\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/statistiki\">Статистики</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-[88rem]\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><p class=\"text-sm mb-4\"><a href=\"/kalkulatori\">← <!-- -->Калкулатори</a></p><p class=\"text-[15px] text-green font-semibold mb-2\">Калкулатор</p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Колко време работя за това</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Цената в часове работа: колко време трябва да работите за хляб, сирене, гориво или телефон.</div></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,5fr)_minmax(0,7fr)]\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Вашата бруто заплата</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"50\" min=\"0\" value=\"1500\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€/месец</span></div><span class=\"block text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Пълно работно време, 168 часа месечно.</span></label><p class=\"text-[15px]\">Изкарвате нето <b>6,93 €</b> на час (при минимална заплата: <!-- -->2,86 €<!-- -->).</p><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold pt-2\">Сметнете нещо свое</p><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Какво</span><input value=\"Нов телефон\"/></label><label class=\"block\"><span class=\"block text-sm font-semibold mb-1\">Цена</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" step=\"10\" min=\"0\" value=\"800\"/><span class=\"text-muted text-sm whitespace-nowrap\">€</span></div></label></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-xl p-5 sm:p-7 self-start\"><div aria-live=\"polite\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Нов телефон<!-- --> ви струва</p><p class=\"display num text-[3rem] mt-1\">14,4 работни дни</p><p class=\"text-[15px] mt-1\">работа. На минимална заплата: <!-- -->34,9 работни дни<!-- -->.</p><p class=\"font-semibold mt-6 mb-2\">Основни стоки (типична цена в магазините)</p><table class=\"w-full text-[15px] num\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-sm text-muted border-b border-rule\"><th class=\"py-1 font-normal\">Стока</th><th class=\"font-normal text-right\">Цена</th><th class=\"font-normal text-right\">Вие</th><th class=\"font-normal text-right\">Мин. заплата</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Бял хляб</td><td class=\"text-right\">1,12 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">10 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">23 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Типов хляб</td><td class=\"text-right\">1,09 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">9 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">23 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Прясно мляко 2–3,6%, 1 л</td><td class=\"text-right\">1,73 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">15 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">36 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Кисело мляко 2–3,6%</td><td class=\"text-right\">0,86 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">7 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">18 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Сирене, насипно, 1 кг</td><td class=\"text-right\">8,99 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">1 ч. 18 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">3 ч. 8 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Краве масло</td><td class=\"text-right\">2,99 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">26 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">1 ч. 3 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Пиле, цяло, охладено, 1 кг</td><td class=\"text-right\">4,49 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">39 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">1 ч. 34 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Пилешко филе, 1 кг</td><td class=\"text-right\">8,50 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">1 ч. 14 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">2 ч. 58 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Кайма 60/40, 1 кг</td><td class=\"text-right\">6,90 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">60 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">2 ч. 25 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Яйца M</td><td class=\"text-right\">2,49 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">22 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">52 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Боб, 1 кг</td><td class=\"text-right\">2,79 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">24 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">58 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Ориз, 1 кг</td><td class=\"text-right\">2,14 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">19 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">45 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Захар, 1 кг</td><td class=\"text-right\">1,04 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">9 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">22 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Брашно тип 500, 1 кг</td><td class=\"text-right\">0,97 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">8 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">20 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Олио, 1 л</td><td class=\"text-right\">1,89 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">16 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">40 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Банани, 1 кг</td><td class=\"text-right\">1,95 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">17 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">41 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Ябълки, 1 кг</td><td class=\"text-right\">1,67 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">14 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">35 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Домати, 1 кг</td><td class=\"text-right\">2,69 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">23 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">56 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Кромид лук, 1 кг</td><td class=\"text-right\">0,75 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">6 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">16 мин.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-1 pr-2\">Картофи, 1 кг</td><td class=\"text-right\">1,10 €</td><td class=\"text-right\">10 мин.</td><td class=\"text-right text-muted\">23 мин.</td></tr></tbody></table><details class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-muted border-t border-rule pt-3\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer text-ink\">Какво сме допуснали и откъде са числата</summary><ul class=\"mt-2 space-y-1\"><li>Минимална заплата<!-- -->: <span class=\"num text-ink\">620,20 €/месец</span>, в сила от <!-- -->1.01.2026 г.<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <a href=\"https://nra.bg/wps/portal/nra/actualno/vpisvane_v_registura_na_zaetostta_vuv_vruzka_s_opredelenata_mrz_ot_01.01.2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">ПМС № 243 от 13.11.2025 г. (ДВ, бр. 98/2025), съобщение на НАП</a></li><li>Осигуровки на работника<!-- -->: <span class=\"num text-ink\">13,78%</span> (пенсии 6,58 + ДЗПО 2,2 + ОЗМ 1,4 + безработица 0,4 + здравно 3,2)<!-- -->, в сила от <!-- -->1.08.2026 г.<!-- --> ·<!-- --> <a href=\"https://kik-info.com/novini/novini-i-akcenti/Ot-01082026-Osigurovki-MOD-TZPB-bolnichni.208156.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Осигуровки, МОД, ТЗПБ от 01.08.2026 (ДВ бр. 68/2026), kik-info.com</a></li></ul></details><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-4\">Цените са типичните (медианни) от „Колко струва“ на КЗП към <!-- -->22.11.2026<!-- -->. Часовете са нетни: след осигуровки и данък.</p></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"bg-surface border-t border-rule mt-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 text-sm text-muted grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2\"><p>Не подкрепяме партия, кандидат или правителство. Всяко число има източник и дата.<!-- --> <a href=\"/metodologiya\">Как работим</a> · <a href=\"/rechnik\">Речник</a> · <a href=\"/sastoyanie\">Състояние на данните</a> · <!--$?--><template id=\"B:1\"></template><a href=\"/metodologiya#greshki\">Съобщи за грешка</a><!--/$--></p><p class=\"sm:text-right\">Вътрешен прототип · данните са към датите, посочени до тях</p></div></footer><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script 